    "title": "Current Human Owner Skill directory and details",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Independent read-only adapter for the P2 published builtin. Not installed in the default root. No package stream, installation, assignment, pagination or UI. Unknown read transactions do not publish candidates."
  },
